# The cable is pulled one hour into 6 hours of monitoring and plugged in again 90 minutes later. The monitor loses the counter,
# searches every 15 s for 5 minutes (probing the serial port of another device on the way), takes a temporary exit for 30
# minutes, searches again, finds the counter and fills the gap from its log. One foreign serial port that never answers.
source yarrow
interval 600
hours 6
cpm 20
seed 1
unplug_at 3600
unplug_for 5400
foreign_ports 1
